{{Quote|Trace, I'll do the right thing. I'll meet you at the wharf, okay?|Rafa Martez to Trace Martez|<ref name="Gone with a Trace" />}}
'''The wharf''' was a location on [[Level 1313]] of [[Coruscant]]'s sprawling [[Coruscant Underworld|underworld]]. It had an underground [[lake]], [[speeder]] docks, and [[Ronto Grill]], a restaurant with outdoor seating. [[Ahsoka Tano]] and [[Trace Martez]] got a meal there after dealing with some dangerous [[binary loadlifter]]s Trace's sister [[Rafa Martez|Rafa]] had been hired to work on. Rafa later met them there, revealing that she had sold the [[droid]]s to the [[Twi'lek]] who had hired her anyways, despite the danger, which Tano and Trace were not pleased about.<ref name="Gone with a Trace" />

==Behind the scenes==
The wharf first appeared in the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' [[The Clone Wars: Season Seven|seventh season]] episode "[[Gone with a Trace]]."<ref name="Gone with a Trace" />

